  sting: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f43eaa34cb7ba2143b518d20c32e1477, type: 3}
  stabs: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a27ce9c678fde0f48b4e5c0e9b5ee0ff, type: 3}
  whisper: {fileID: 0}
  goHome: Go home - Flat 2B, second floor
  findDerek: Find Derek
  checkTape: Check the camera footage - the PC in the living room
  chase: Chase him
  timeCard: SATURDAY  -  6:38 AM
  arriveLines: Van's in. Keys are in. Clocked out.|Twelve hours on the road... I'll
    walk home.|Derek promised breakfast. First time in weeks he's sounded like himself.
  doorOpenLines: ...our door's open.|Derek never leaves it open. Not since he started
    locking everything.
  callOut: Derek? I'm home!
  noAnswer: ...Derek?
  bodyLines: Derek...?|No. No, no, no--|DEREK! Come on, wake up! WAKE UP!|...he's
    cold.|Who did this to you...?
  cameraIdea: The camera. He put one up in the bedroom last month. Said he felt like
    he was being watched.|If someone did this... it saw them.
  tapeStart: Playback. This morning, 06:52.
  afterTape: That face... I've never seen him before in my life.|He was HERE. In
    our home.|...06:52. That was twenty minutes ago.
  footstepLines: ...footsteps.|Someone's still in the flat.
  spottedLine: YOU!
  escapedLines: The front door--!|He was hiding in here the whole time!
  upLines: He's going UP, not down!|You're not getting away!
  topLines: The roof. There's nowhere left to go.|He's trapped.
  confrontLines: 'Nowhere left to run.|Why him? WHY DEREK?!|Elias: My name is Elias
    Rourke. Your brother knew why.|Elias: Ask your boss about Tomas.|Rourke...? Tomas
    Rourke... the cleaner who went missing?|...I don''t care. I DON''T CARE.|You''re
    going to pay for this.'
  grabLines: He grabs my wrist--|NO--!
